’m marking this release as Beta, as I expect there to be bugs and rough edges that will need fixing. I’ll be actively working on patches throughout the next week based on your feedback.\n\nThe scope of this update ended up being much larger than I originally planned, so alongside bug fixes, I’ll also be making adjustments and improvements as we go.\n\n### ❤️ Support the Development\n\n**This update was made possible in large part thanks to my Patreon supporters.** In my current situation, every patron directly provides resources that allow me to keep working on updates like this.\n\nIf you enjoy my work, please consider becoming a patron and directly supporting Aquamirae and my other projects. Every bit of support genuinely helps!\n\nWelcome to The Maelstrom. 🌊", "changelog_url": null, "date_published": "2026-07-25T15:05:16.788505Z", "downloads": 843, "version_type": "beta", "status": "listed", "requested_status": null, "files": [{"id": "V1pZ8bu8", "hashes": {"sha1": "0d7196955100d273126435e654d3a0f37fdf2ad9", "sha512": "c88acb6f9a5432d48bd838fa3cc667d65ffc4bd803e4c33776424ee54b4302de588800a4a19c29e744f37b4124c10d2858a10455c71e93dba4af44340d528fe0"}, "url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/k23mNPhZ/versions/zeYUuDOa/aquamirae-forge-1.20.1-7.0.0.jar", "filename": "aquamirae-forge-1.20.1-7.0.0.jar", "primary": true, "size": 39493529, "file_type": null}], "dependencies": [{"version_id": null, "project_id": "49C5QgTK", "file_name": null, "dependency_type": "required"}, {"version_id": null, "project_id": "8BmcQJ2H", "file_name": null, "dependency_type": "required"}]}, {"game_versions": ["1.20.1"], "loaders": ["forge"], "environment": "client_and_server", "id": "A6aIqoJZ", "project_id": "k23mNPhZ", "author_id": "JYGX3M0u", "featured": false, "name": "Aquamirae 6.4.0", "version_number": "6.4.0", "changelog": "* Added an experimental world generation type, **Endless Ice Maze** (available alongside vanilla presets like Superflat). Many players were trying to create a world wit